---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const homeHref = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base title="Privacy Notice | MARIS Residences Demo" description="Privacy and form processing information for the fictional MARIS Residences real-estate portfolio website." path="/privacy/">
<header class="site-header"><div class="site-container header-inner"><a href={homeHref} class="wordmark">MARIS<span class="wordmark-dot">.</span><small>R E S I D E N C E S</small></a><a class="header-cta" href={homeHref}>← Back to website</a></div></header>
<main id="main" class="legal-page"><div class="site-container"><p class="overline">Portfolio demonstration / privacy</p><h1 class="display-heading">Privacy <em>notice.</em></h1><p class="legal-intro">This is a fictional real-estate portfolio website. It is not a real property business.</p><h2>Forms and contact details</h2><p>In the default demo configuration, the form validates in your browser and does not submit your details or store them on a backend. If a future operator configures a real submission endpoint, it must publish its own identity, contact details, purposes, lawful basis, retention schedule, third-party recipients and rights information before collecting actual leads. This demonstration is not that operator's policy.</p><h2>Campaign attribution</h2><p>The page may read UTM parameters and a GCLID from the current URL and save them in session storage in your browser for up to 30 days. They are included in a consented payload only if a real endpoint is configured and you submit the form. They are not transmitted in the default demo.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>No third-party analytics tags are loaded by default. An optional first-party dataLayer event interface exists but requires explicit configuration and an appropriate consent/notice solution before commercial use.</p><h2>Contact and erasure</h2><p>No contact mailbox or operator identity is asserted for this portfolio demo. If a production operator implements this site, it must replace this text with its verified contact information and operational data rights process.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>The concept illustrations and floor plans are original site assets; the site does not require third-party image services. Optional future CRM endpoints must use HTTPS.</p><p><a href={homeHref} class="text-link">← Return to MARIS</a></p></div></main>
</Base>
